    <briefdescription>
<para>Defines the on-disk format and versioning for Paimon file-level indexes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Supports V1 and V2 containers. V2 uses int64 offsets and lengths and supports streaming index payloads directly to the output; avoiding full payload buffering requires a streaming WriteTo() implementation in the index plugin. See file_index_format_v1.h and file_index_format_v2.h for the serialized layouts. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
